  "body": "I would like to propose some new properties to the `HTMLCanvasElement`. Name suggestion and functionality:\n\n```\nMAX_WIDTH  --or-- MAX_BITMAP_WIDTH\nMAX_HEIGHT --or-- MAX_BITMAP_HEIGHT\n```\n\nset internally by the browser vendor to indicate maximum size that is allowed/can be created in this browser. Helpful as we don't have to guess or make a function that will have to resize and test until an error is thrown (keywords: photo enhancements apps, retina displays, allow to calculate proper pre-scaling steps until possibly bilinear and hopefully Lanczos becomes available through `imageSmoothingQuality`).\n\nAnd for `CanvasRenderingContext2D` instance:\n\n```\ncontext.tainted -or- context.isTainted\n```\n\nto avoid hard errors (i.e. security error 18) stopping the script.\n\nI don't know if some of this has been proposed, is evaluated or has been rejected in the past. In any case, thanks for reading, and keep up the good work!\n",
